              "headline": "Mara Ellison",
              "subhead": "Documentary photographer",
              "body": "I photograph slow stories: coastal towns losing their industry, the people who stay, and the shape a place takes when the work leaves. Most of my projects run for two years or more.",
              "bodySecondary": "Commissions have taken me to thirty-one countries for editorial and NGO clients. The method never changes much: arrive early, stay late, and let people decide how they want to be seen."
