              "eyebrow": "How I work",
              "headline": "Access Before Composition",
              "body": "A photograph is only as honest as the relationship behind it. I spend the first weeks of a project without a camera, which is why the later frames look like nobody is performing.",
              "bodySecondary": "Everything is shot on film and scanned in house, so what you commission is what you receive. No retouching beyond dust, dodging and burning."
